{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1184865-new-let-s-read-of-night-horrors-the-unbidden","id":1184865,"title":"New Let's Read of Night Horrors: The Unbidden","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-02-11T13:31:48-08:00","id":1184865,"title":"New Let's Read of Night Horrors: The Unbidden","content":"You may remember me from that other Let's Read of Night Horrors: Conquering Heroes.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/showthread.php?823385-CofD-Sir-Night-Compiles-Night-Horrors-The-Unbidden-(In-Character-Let-s-Read)\" target=\"_blank\">Well, the good demon Sir Night is back at it again</a>, and with 70% less dickishness! Yeah, he's working for a person he actually likes now, and thus I don't feel the urge to do the turbo-asshole act that was happening for the first few posts of Conquering Heroes.<br /> <br /> I just finished Brother Ben-any suggestions as to how this latest job will go horribly awry?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-11T13:40:59-08:00","id":1184872,"title":"","content":"Ah,it's back. Yaaaaay","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-11T19:34:22-08:00","id":1184989,"title":"","content":"Wow. That's a heckuva blast from the past. I did my first bit of WoD freelance work for The Unbidden. I think I might be a bit embarrassed at how rough my stuff was back then. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/redface.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Embarrassment\" smilieid=\"2\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> The Night Horrors books are nifty in part because they make a great entry point for new writers. Give them 3k-6k words and find out whether they can write well and hit a deadline. And if one or two of those new writers find out that it's just not for them it's comparatively easy for a seasoned freelancer to pinch hit on short notice (that's like one week's output for me, and I'm a gig freelancer with kids). On the other hand, some of those new hands come at things in surprising and cools ways, so I've always found that at least a couple of entries from unknown writers turn out to be utterly amazing - not at all something I would have come up with, but that's what makes them so interesting.<br /> <br /> Anyway, it will be interesting to see what you and the rest of the crew do with this supplement. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/browse.php?x=0&amp;y=0&amp;author=Eric%20Zawadzki\" target=\"_blank\">Onyx Path Freelancer</a></b> and former Deviant line developer.<br /> <br /> Deviant projects now on STV: <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/486079/Shallow-Graves?affiliate_id=54122\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Shallow Graves</b></a> and <a href=\"https://site.storytellersvault.com/product/550535/Black-Vans?affiliate_id=54122\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Black Vans</b></a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/Dayzdark\" target=\"_blank\">Updates and excerpts of current projects available here</a>.\u200b","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1094-eric-zawadzki","name":"Eric Zawadzki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-11T19:53:51-08:00","id":1184993,"title":"","content":"Awesome! I haven't made it through any of your Let's Reads yet, but I always enjoy the part that I have read.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"a